  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAARC Development Fund - Capacity and Institutional Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the IDF grant is to improve SAARC Development Fund&#x2019;s (SDF) capacity to meet its organizational objectives by strengthening its capacity to plan, implement, supervise, monitor and evaluate its activities through the design and implementation of a results-based Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) framework and system; the design and implementation of SDF&#x2019;s Infrastructure and Economic Investment Windows; and general institutional strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
